  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "An enormous hall moves through the clouds and descends above grassland as Nu Er tribe arrives for the blood battle competition. Inside, Nu Er Gu controls Loud Thunder Hall, treats its strength as overflowing, and laughs that the tribe has the hall to suppress the situation. Under the house’s amplification, Nu Er Qian’s gaze pierces an enormous distance and picks out Gong tribe’s Golden Dawn Hall. Nu Er tribe does not stint on mobilizing this tribe Immortal Gu House, and seating puts Nu Er tribe first from the right because they brought it.",
